WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:04.173
Welcome to Module 9: Code-based Agentic Workflows.

2
00:00:04.173 --> 00:00:08.800
When a workflow outgrows a visual canvas, you build it in code.

3
00:00:10.200 --> 00:00:20.040
You will learn what agent SDKs provide, compare eight Python SDKs, and reach free and commercial models through the OpenRouter and Commonstack gateways.

4
00:00:21.440 --> 00:00:35.652
You will start with a tiny agent framework in plain Python, then compare the OpenAI Agents SDK, the Claude Agent SDK, LangChain, CrewAI, smolagents, Pydantic AI, AutoGen, and Magentic-One.

5
00:00:35.652 --> 00:00:41.700
Finally, you will load an API key safely and build the same agent in seven SDKs.

6
00:00:43.100 --> 00:00:51.070
The key takeaway: SDKs handle the plumbing and gateways make models interchangeable, so you can focus on designing the workflow.
